This repository is a snapshot of YADE (Yet Another Dynamic Engine), the free
discrete-element code. The whole upstream YADE tree is included, so its copyright
notices (kept in the individual files) and its licence apply to it unchanged.

Copyright (C) 2026 by Chang GUO <chang.guo@connect.polyu.hk>

  covers the components added on top of that tree -- the DirectShear suite
  (DirectShearBox / DirectShearBox6D / DirectShearBoxRecorder / timeSaver), the
  capillary model for the 6D (cohesive-frictional) contact model (CapillaryCohPhys
  and Law2_ScGeom6D_CapillaryCohPhys_Capillarity) and the Shop / python helpers
  that go with them -- as well as the modifications made to existing files.

Upstream files that were modified here, each carrying a notice of the change in
its header:

  pkg/common/Recorder.hpp                            Recorder::out made public
  pkg/dem/CapillaryPhys.hpp / .cpp                   CapillaryCohPhys and its IPhys functor
  pkg/dem/Law2_ScGeom_CapillaryPhys_Capillarity.hpp  virtual destructors, virtual checkFusion()
  preprocessing/dem/Shop.hpp / Shop_02.cpp           the capillary / 6D helper functions
  py/_utils.cpp                                      those helpers exposed to python

